    "summary": "Slip catalogue:\r\nPipe formed of a double gourd in the top of which a very short bamboo tube is insered to contain a mouth-piece. The lower gourd is perforated near the top to receive a short bamboo tube. Surmounted by a small bowl of black pottery shaped like an hour glass, round the centre of which is a piece of fibre. Round the junction of the two parts of the gourd is tied a cord in three lengths. The pipe has been much smoked.",
